ally sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm stellate  tan  fibrous lesion with a surgical clip  located in the lower inner quadrant  0 3cm from the anterior margin  and 5 0cm from the nearest posterior margin  This lesion is located 3 0cm inferomedial to the nipple  and is designated lesion  1  In addition  a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm brown ovoid lesion  with surrounding fibrosis and punctate  chalky yellow areas consistent with fat necrosis  is present in the lower outer quadrant located 2 5cm from the anterior resection margin and 6 0cm from the nearest posterior resection  This lesion is designated lesion  2  and is located 6 0cm lateral to lesion  1  In addition  a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm yellow tan  firm area is present in the lower outer quadrant  located 2 0cm from the anterior resection margin  and 6 0cm from the posterior resection margin  This focus is located 2 0cm lateral to lesion  2 and is designated as lesion  3  In addition  a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm hemorrhagic fibrous area is present  located 3 2cm inferior to the nipple areolar complex anteriorly  and 4 0cm from the posterior resection margin  This lesion is designated lesion  4  The remainder of the fibroadipose tissue is grossly unremarkable  No axillary lymph nodes are identified  A separate piece of unremarkable skin measuring 18 0x0 6x0 4cm is present in the same container  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion  1  entirely submitted  with anterior margin  area of clip in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  bisected   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative posterior margin to lesion  1   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion  2  entirely submitted   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of anterior and posterior margin to lesion  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of firm area  lesion  3    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of hemorrhagic area  lesion  4    R