 hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  10 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 13 49                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTSIDE LOCATION REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Simon Powell  M D  Michael L Grossbard  M D  OUTSIDE INSTITUTION  THE CAMBRIDGE HOSPITAL OUTSIDE PATHOLOGIST  John P  Grabbe  M D  PATHOLOGY DEPT   CAMBRIDGE HOSPITAL  REMOVED_CASE_ID  CAMBRIDGE STREET CAMBRIDGE  MA  REMOVED_CASE_ID  PART   RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY  97  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Date of Procedure  22 JAN  REMOVED_CASE_ID  Slides  2 Blocks  1 , No.
